{"id":"6cb45d716150df5b","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-inverse-limit.md","title":"明确递归链上的反身域","display":"thm-inverse-limit-domain — 明确递归链上的反身域","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-thm-inverse-limit","aliases":["16-thm-inverse-limit","16-thm--inverse-limit"],"display":"thm-inverse-limit-domain — 明确递归链上的反身域","depends_on":["[[16-df-embedding-projection]]","[[16-df-cpo]]","[[16-df-dcpo-function-space]]","[[16-thm-dcpo-exponential]]","[[16-thm-ep-bilimit]]"],"review_status":"resolved-by-local-proof","review_priority":"P1","review_note_id":"J08","review_date":"2026-10-15","source":"§2.5.3(ii) p. 156 (PDF 176), mentions D-infinity; explicit recursive construction and proof in note","revision_date":"2026-10-15","verification_status":"proved-in-note"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-inverse-limit"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-inverse-limit</span><span>16-thm--inverse-limit</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-inverse-limit-domain — 明确递归链上的反身域"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ef7dfd09239bb0b1\" href=\"?note=ef7dfd09239bb0b1\" title=\"16-df-embedding-projection\">16-df-embedding-projection</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d561a55729f9cdb8\" href=\"?note=d561a55729f9cdb8\" title=\"16-df-cpo\">16-df-cpo</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a101152a4f31cd83\" href=\"?note=a101152a4f31cd83\" title=\"16-df-dcpo-function-space\">16-df-dcpo-function-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6e7c6dac50ba7c59\" href=\"?note=6e7c6dac50ba7c59\" title=\"16-thm-dcpo-exponential\">16-thm-dcpo-exponential</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fc728ef2e25025aa\" href=\"?note=fc728ef2e25025aa\" title=\"16-thm-ep-bilimit\">16-thm-ep-bilimit</a></span></div>"},{"key":"review_status","html":"resolved-by-local-proof"},{"key":"review_priority","html":"P1"},{"key":"review_note_id","html":"J08"},{"key":"review_date","html":"2026-10-15"},{"key":"source","html":"§2.5.3(ii) p. 156 (PDF 176), mentions D-infinity; explicit recursive construction and proof in note"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-15"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_0\">\\(D_0\\)</span> 为小的带底 dcpo，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_0\">\\(\\bot_0\\)</span> 为其最小元；连续函数空间见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a101152a4f31cd83\" href=\"?note=a101152a4f31cd83\" title=\"16-df-dcpo-function-space\">16-df-dcpo-function-space</a> 及 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6e7c6dac50ba7c59\" href=\"?note=6e7c6dac50ba7c59\" title=\"16-thm-dcpo-exponential\">16-thm-dcpo-exponential</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>以下递归在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 上进行，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{n+1}=[D_n,D_n]\">\\(D_{n+1}=[D_n,D_n]\\)</span>；所有函数空间均带逐点序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_\\infty,\\pi_n,\\iota_n,a_n\">\\(D_\\infty,\\pi_n,\\iota_n,a_n\\)</span> 由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"fc728ef2e25025aa\" href=\"?note=fc728ef2e25025aa\" title=\"16-thm-ep-bilimit\">16-thm-ep-bilimit</a> 的显式构造给出；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta(f)\">\\(\\beta(f)\\)</span> 的坐标覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 与所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CPO},\\mathrm{ScottCont}\">\\(\\mathrm{CPO},\\mathrm{ScottCont}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d561a55729f9cdb8\" href=\"?note=d561a55729f9cdb8\" title=\"16-df-cpo\">16-df-cpo</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EP}_{D,E}\">\\(\\mathrm{EP}_{D,E}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"ef7dfd09239bb0b1\" href=\"?note=ef7dfd09239bb0b1\" title=\"16-df-embedding-projection\">16-df-embedding-projection</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nD_{n+1}&amp;\\coloneqq[D_n,D_n],\\\\\ne_0(d)&amp;\\coloneqq(x\\mapsto d),&amp;p_0(f)&amp;\\coloneqq f(\\bot_0),\\\\\ne_{n+1}(f)&amp;\\coloneqq e_n\\circ f\\circ p_n,\n&amp;p_{n+1}(g)&amp;\\coloneqq p_n\\circ g\\circ e_n,\\\\\n\\alpha(x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigsqcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}(\\iota_n\\circ x_{n+1}\\circ\\pi_n),\\\\\n(\\beta(f))_{n+1}&amp;\\coloneqq\\pi_n\\circ f\\circ\\iota_n,\n&amp;(\\beta(f))_0&amp;\\coloneqq p_0(\\pi_0\\circ f\\circ\\iota_0).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nD_{n+1}&amp;\\coloneqq[D_n,D_n],\\\\\ne_0(d)&amp;\\coloneqq(x\\mapsto d),&amp;p_0(f)&amp;\\coloneqq f(\\bot_0),\\\\\ne_{n+1}(f)&amp;\\coloneqq e_n\\circ f\\circ p_n,\n&amp;p_{n+1}(g)&amp;\\coloneqq p_n\\circ g\\circ e_n,\\\\\n\\alpha(x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigsqcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}(\\iota_n\\circ x_{n+1}\\circ\\pi_n),\\\\\n(\\beta(f))_{n+1}&amp;\\coloneqq\\pi_n\\circ f\\circ\\iota_n,\n&amp;(\\beta(f))_0&amp;\\coloneqq p_0(\\pi_0\\circ f\\circ\\iota_0).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n(\\forall n)\\ \\mathrm{CPO}(D_n,\\leq_{D_n})\\land\\mathrm{EP}_{D_n,D_{n+1}}(e_n,p_n),\\\\\n\\mathrm{CPO}(D_\\infty,\\leq_\\infty),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{ScottCont}(\\alpha,D_\\infty,[D_\\infty,D_\\infty]),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{ScottCont}(\\beta,[D_\\infty,D_\\infty],D_\\infty),\\\\\n\\alpha\\circ\\beta=\\operatorname{id}_{[D_\\infty,D_\\infty]},\\qquad\n\\beta\\circ\\alpha=\\operatorname{id}_{D_\\infty}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n(\\forall n)\\ \\mathrm{CPO}(D_n,\\leq_{D_n})\\land\\mathrm{EP}_{D_n,D_{n+1}}(e_n,p_n),\\\\\n\\mathrm{CPO}(D_\\infty,\\leq_\\infty),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{ScottCont}(\\alpha,D_\\infty,[D_\\infty,D_\\infty]),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{ScottCont}(\\beta,[D_\\infty,D_\\infty],D_\\infty),\\\\\n\\alpha\\circ\\beta=\\operatorname{id}_{[D_\\infty,D_\\infty]},\\qquad\n\\beta\\circ\\alpha=\\operatorname{id}_{D_\\infty}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_0e_0=\\operatorname{id}\">\\(p_0e_0=\\operatorname{id}\\)</span>，且常函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\mapsto f(\\bot_0)\">\\(x\\mapsto f(\\bot_0)\\)</span> 逐点小于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>。归纳假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"pe=\\operatorname{id},ep\\leq\\operatorname{id}\">\\(pe=\\operatorname{id},ep\\leq\\operatorname{id}\\)</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_{n+1}e_{n+1}=\\operatorname{id}\">\\(p_{n+1}e_{n+1}=\\operatorname{id}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_{n+1}p_{n+1}(g)=(e_np_n)g(e_np_n)\\leq g\">\\(e_{n+1}p_{n+1}(g)=(e_np_n)g(e_np_n)\\leq g\\)</span>。函数空间定理保证每层及各构造连续。极限定理适用。</p>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in D_\\infty\">\\(x\\in D_\\infty\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_{n+1}=p_nx_{n+2}e_n\">\\(x_{n+1}=p_nx_{n+2}e_n\\)</span>，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_nx_{n+1}\\pi_n\\leq\\iota_{n+1}x_{n+2}\\pi_{n+1}\">\\(\\iota_nx_{n+1}\\pi_n\\leq\\iota_{n+1}x_{n+2}\\pi_{n+1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 的上确界有定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta(f)\">\\(\\beta(f)\\)</span> 的相容性由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_n=p_n\\pi_{n+1}\">\\(\\pi_n=p_n\\pi_{n+1}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_n=\\iota_{n+1}e_n\">\\(\\iota_n=\\iota_{n+1}e_n\\)</span> 得到。两映射连续逐点核对。</p>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_n=\\iota_n\\pi_n\">\\(a_n=\\iota_n\\pi_n\\)</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\beta(f)=\\bigsqcup_na_nfa_n=f\">\\(\\alpha\\beta(f)=\\bigsqcup_na_nfa_n=f\\)</span>：对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，先用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_nx\\uparrow x\">\\(a_nx\\uparrow x\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 连续，再用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_n\\uparrow\\operatorname{id}\">\\(a_n\\uparrow\\operatorname{id}\\)</span>；两指标可沿共同较大指标合并。另一方面，对于固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\geq n\">\\(m\\geq n\\)</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_n\\iota_m x_{m+1}\\pi_m\\iota_n=p_{n,m}x_{m+1}e_{n,m}=x_{n+1}\">\\(\\pi_n\\iota_m x_{m+1}\\pi_m\\iota_n=p_{n,m}x_{m+1}e_{n,m}=x_{n+1}\\)</span>。小于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的项在其下，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\beta\\alpha(x))_{n+1}=x_{n+1}\">\\((\\beta\\alpha(x))_{n+1}=x_{n+1}\\)</span>；第零分量由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_0\">\\(p_0\\)</span> 相容性推出。</p>\n<p>本页将旧的“函数空间近似相干”文字前提替换成确定的递归箭头。来源边界：§2.5.3(ii), p. 156 (PDF 176) 提及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_\\infty\">\\(D_\\infty\\)</span>；这里的完整极限证明是本地补写，未声称原书逐行证明了该构造。底 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_0\">\\(D_0\\)</span> 可取非平凡带底有限链；取单点也合法但只产生平凡域。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-embedding-projection","status":"resolved","id":"ef7dfd09239bb0b1","anc