$\\mathrm{EP}_{D,E}$ 采用 [[16-df-embedding-projection]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-embedding-projection","status":"resolved","id":"ef7dfd09239bb0b1","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CPO},\\mathrm{ScottCont}$ 采用 [[16-df-cpo]]；$\\mathrm{EP}_{D,E}$ 采用 [[16-df-embedding-projection]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"D_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot_0","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"D_{n+1}=[D_n,D_n]","display":false},{"tex":"D_\\infty,\\pi_n,\\iota_n,a_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta(f)","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"n+1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CPO},\\mathrm{ScottCont}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EP}_{D,E}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nD_{n+1}&\\coloneqq[D_n,D_n],\\\\\ne_0(d)&\\coloneqq(x\\mapsto d),&p_0(f)&\\coloneqq f(\\bot_0),\\\\\ne_{n+1}(f)&\\coloneqq e_n\\circ f\\circ p_n,\n&p_{n+1}(g)&\\coloneqq p_n\\circ g\\circ e_n,\\\\\n\\alpha(x)&\\coloneqq\\bigsqcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}(\\iota_n\\circ x_{n+1}\\circ\\pi_n),\\\\\n(\\beta(f))_{n+1}&\\coloneqq\\pi_n\\circ f\\circ\\iota_n,\n&(\\beta(f))_0&\\coloneqq p_0(\\pi_0\\circ f\\circ\\iota_0).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n(\\forall n)\\ \\mathrm{CPO}(D_n,\\leq_{D_n})\\land\\mathrm{EP}_{D_n,D_{n+1}}(e_n,p_n),\\\\\n\\mathrm{CPO}(D_\\infty,\\leq_\\infty),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{ScottCont}(\\alpha,D_\\infty,[D_\\infty,D_\\infty]),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{ScottCont}(\\beta,[D_\\infty,D_\\infty],D_\\infty),\\\\\n\\alpha\\circ\\beta=\\operatorname{id}_{[D_\\infty,D_\\infty]},\\qquad\n\\beta\\circ\\alpha=\\operatorname{id}_{D_\\infty}.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"p_0e_0=\\operatorname{id}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\mapsto f(\\bot_0)","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"pe=\\operatorname{id},ep\\leq\\operatorname{id}","display":false},{"tex":"p_{n+1}e_{n+1}=\\operatorname{id}","display":false},{"tex":"e_{n+1}p_{n+1}(g)=(e_np_n)g(e_np_n)\\leq g","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in D_\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"x_{n+1}=p_nx_{n+2}e_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota_nx_{n+1}\\pi_n\\leq\\iota_{n+1}x_{n+2}\\pi_{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_n=p_n\\pi_{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota_n=\\iota_{n+1}e_n","display":false},{"tex":"a_n=\\iota_n\\pi_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\beta(f)=\\bigsqcup_na_nfa_n=f","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"a_nx\\uparrow x","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"a_n\\uparrow\\operatorname{id}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"m\\geq n","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_n\\iota_m x_{m+1}\\pi_m\\iota_n=p_{n,m}x_{m+1}e_{n,m}=x_{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"(\\beta\\alpha(x))_{n+1}=x_{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"p_0","display":false},{"tex":"D_\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"D_0","display":false}],"bytes":3444,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-53","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-cpo]]、[[16-df-dcpo-function-space]]、[[16-thm-dcpo-exponential]]、[[16-df-embedding-projection]]、[[16-thm-ep-properties]]、[[16-thm-ep-bilimit]]、[[16-thm-inverse-limit]]、[[16-df-lambda-category]]、[[16-thm-domain-model]]。极限构造的完整证明是明示的本地补写；λ-category 按 §2.5 的指定反身对象接口定义。"},{"id":"343cd2798c360ffe","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"来源：Example 2.5.3(ii), p. 156 (PDF 176)；泛性质为 Lemma 2.5.2, p. 155 (PDF 175)。本页完整构造书中的有限幂基范畴，并核对 λ 范畴接口；没有把两个 β/η 元素等式直接替代范畴构造。$\\mathrm{LambdaModel}$ 在此限定为反身 dcpo 模型存在性，不是未经定义的任意演算可靠性谓词。[[16-thm-inverse-limit]] 给出一项有本地证明的具体反身域构造。"}],"outgoing":["ef7dfd09239bb0b1","d561a55729f9cdb8","a101152a4f31cd83","6e7c6dac50ba7c59","fc728ef2e25025aa"]}